14:46.700 --> 14:47.620
and a nice long yellow.

14:47.620 --> 14:49.500
one and it'll all work.

14:49.500 --> 14:50.800
Okay, everybody, that's it.

14:50.800 --> 14:52.640
I'll talk to you tomorrow.

14:52.640 --> 14:52.960
Bye.

